    "text": "The projection of the line segment joining the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on the line joining the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2,10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is _______",
    "image": null
  },
