  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let A <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> , B <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />C <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi></mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> , D <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Projection of <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>56</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
